{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":1,"exerciseID":"0EwDSH8gglQWDZgCAyk","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":7,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"七年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"(1)在甲超市购买实付款为440元，在乙超市购买实付款为450元(2)750元(3)576.4元","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5ed76757a47b5ff80031811d","queId":"0EwDSH8gglQWDZgCAyk","schCode":"0000","textbookId":"5ed740d9004931cec743eee4"}],"question":"某市两超市在元旦期间分别推出如下促销方式：甲超市：全场均按八八折优惠；乙超市：购物不超过300元，不给与优惠；超过300元而不超过600元一律打九折；超过600元时，其中的600元优惠10%，超过的部分打八折；已知两家超市相同商品的标价都一样．","solution":"(1)在甲超市实付款为：500×0.88＝440（元）；在乙超市实付款为：500×0.9＝450（元）．∴在甲超市购买实付款为440元，在乙超市购买实付款为450元；(2)设当购物总额为x元时，两家超市实付款相同，根据题意得：0.88x＝600×0.9+0.8（x﹣600），解之得，x＝750．∴当购物总额为750元时，两家超市实付款相同．(3)设该顾客购物总额为y元，根据题意得：600×0.9+0.8（y﹣600）＝584，解之得，y＝655；∴0.88y＝0.88×655＝576.4（元），∴其在甲超市需实付款576.4元．","subQueNum":3,"subQues":[{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"JyeTnCBzEuQsoKpoK7b","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"0EwDSH8gglQWDZgCAyk","question":"当一次性购物总额是500元时，甲、乙两家超市实付款分别是多少？","sortIndex":1},{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"DIK4IxtwPQ8ZhPWa0Eu","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"0EwDSH8gglQWDZgCAyk","question":"当购物总额是多少时，甲、乙两家超市实付款相同？","sortIndex":2},{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"O4poKFK4QVo8I05ICI6","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"0EwDSH8gglQWDZgCAyk","question":"某顾客购物总额相同，其在乙超市实付款584元，问其在甲超市需实付款多少元？","sortIndex":3}],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5eb904d4eb166234014840aa","knowName":"列一元一次方程解决方案选择问题","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":1,"priority":2,"queId":"0EwDSH8gglQWDZgCAyk","sortIndex":241,"subQueId":"JyeTnCBzEuQsoKpoK7b"},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5eb904d4eb166234014840aa","knowName":"列一元一次方程解决方案选择问题","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":1,"priority":2,"queId":"0EwDSH8gglQWDZgCAyk","sortIndex":241,"subQueId":"DIK4IxtwPQ8ZhPWa0Eu"},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId